# Eval: note-reader

The proof for the `note-reader` hat. Every case names its profile, and every check is
deterministic: a tool called with given arguments, a word in the reply, no card, no change.
No model judges another.

- `reads_shopping`: the hat reads the right note and answers from it.
- `answers_from_the_tool`: `read_note` is a **stand-in** that returns a fixed text, so the
  answer must come from the tool, not from what the model guesses a shopping list holds.
- `cannot_write`: asked to change a note, the hat changes nothing. It is not offered a tool
  that writes, so this holds in code whatever the model replies.

The bar: 3 of 3 cases, 2 runs in a row, on the same binding. Results are recorded per
binding, so the same set proves the hat again on every model you try.

```json
{
  "stew": "2026-11-08-draft",
  "kind": "eval",
  "name": "note-reader",
  "version": 1,
  "changes": {
    "1": "Three cases: read the right note, answer from the tool, change nothing."
  },
  "bar": {
    "passed": 3,
    "of": 3,
    "runs_in_a_row": 2
  },
  "gating": true,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "reads_shopping",
      "profile": "note-reader@1",
      "ask": "What is on the shopping list?",
      "checks": [
        {
          "check": "tool_call_args_match",
          "args": { "tool": "read_note", "name": "shopping" }
        },
        {
          "check": "keyword",
          "args": { "all": ["milk"] }
        },
        "no_card"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "answers_from_the_tool",
      "profile": "note-reader@1",
      "ask": "What is on the shopping list?",
      "stand_ins": [
        { "name": "list_notes", "result": "[\"shopping\"]" },
        { "name": "read_note", "result": "pears\nplums\n" }
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "check": "tool_called",
          "args": { "tool": "read_note" }
        },
        {
          "check": "keyword",
          "args": { "all": ["pears"] }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cannot_write",
      "profile": "note-reader@1",
      "ask": "Replace everything on the shopping list with cake.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "check": "tool_called",
          "args": { "tool": "write_note", "times": 0 }
        },
        "no_change_made",
        "no_card"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
